There are FOUR project-created still wallpapers (11 through 14):
two procedural vector illustrations (11/12) and two FLUX-generated
horror scenes (13/14). The ten downloaded photographs are a separate group.

The original vector wallpapers 11/12, their SVG sources and art previews
are dedicated under CC0 1.0 Universal. Wallpapers 13/14 are fictional
AI-generated images created with FLUX.1 [schnell], not real photographs.
To the extent rights exist in the project contribution to those images and
previews/horror-contact-sheet.jpg, they are also dedicated under CC0.
See ARTWORK-LICENSE for scope, provenance and the AI-output rights disclaimer.
The vector generator remains under this MIT software license.

optional/halloween-jumpscare.webm and optional/the-last-corridor-2.webm are
two owner-supplied Grok animations of scene 13, not new still wallpapers.
Created with Grok. The owner confirmed their generator and requested
publication. They are NOT covered by this MIT license or the artwork CC0
dedication. The qualified dedication of the underlying still and only the
project's own encoding contribution does not override external rights or
conditions. Grok's public output guidance states that users own their outputs
and may use them commercially. Retain the Created with Grok credit with the
distributed animations, without implying provider endorsement.
Output guidance: https://x.ai/legal/faq#who-owns-the-inputs-to-and-outputs-from-grok
Consumer terms: https://x.ai/legal/terms-of-service#4-user-content
Attribution guidance: https://x.ai/legal/brand-guidelines
References checked on 2026-10-19.
See SOURCES.md, sources/optional-jumpscare.json and
sources/optional-corridor-2.json for provenance and parameters.

The ten downloaded wallpapers (numbered 01 through 10) and their thumbnails
retain their individual third-party licenses. See SOURCES.md for attribution,
source links and license notices. They are not covered by this MIT license
or by the project-created artwork's CC0 dedication.

PROJECT-CREATED ARTWORK DEDICATION

The project-created artwork identified above is dedicated to the public domain under
CC0 1.0 Universal, to the extent permitted by law, without warranty.
Legal terms: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/legalcode


DESKTOP SCREENSHOTS

preview.png, previews/halloween.webp and previews/desktop-mansion.png are
captures of a real Omarchy desktop, minimally cropped to 16:9 and, for the
WebP catalog image, reduced to 1200x675. No desktop content is composited.
The screenshot contribution is under this MIT license; depicted software
retains its own rights. The shown wallpapers retain their source licenses:
preview.png and previews/halloween.webp show fictional AI-generated wallpaper
14, Don't Look at the Glass, under the qualified CC0 dedication stated above.
Its generation provenance is documented in sources/13-14-generated.json;
the desktop capture itself is real, not an AI-generated desktop mockup.
previews/desktop-mansion.png shows original wallpaper 12 (CC0 1.0).
These screenshots are not covered by the separate original-art dedication.

